        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sequel to Super drag race game with different  this drag race game your mission is to drive against AI opponents, by racing you earn money and with money you can tune your car like buying better transmission, tires, NOS system and Engines.  drive quarter mile races (402metres)  against AI opponents and earn money. Player can select car from start of game. There is 5 different sport cars an. All cars can select in start and player can make car very fast by winning and racing. There are 3 different tracks: Winter, City and Racetrack. In start player car is rated for 1 star car so very slow but earning money and upgrading car it can be even 5 star super fast car. In drag races player need manually change gears up and down and use nos nitro system. In garage player can also paint car body parts or some parts like hood etc. So make your car fastest in world in this short drag race game sequel</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Steam achievements by playing races and idling at garage<br>- 3 different drag races area<br>- Garage where can modify, tune and paint your cars<br>- 5 different cars to select<br>- Earn money at races and upgrade car better</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint your car</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left Shift: Use NOS nitro system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space bar= Gear Up</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >L = Lights</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Q = Gear Down</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right mouse button = Free look</p>",
